@startuml
title OmniDesk AI Release Pipeline

left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

rectangle "Sprint Increment" as Increment
rectangle "Integration" as Integration
rectangle "Automated Testing" as Testing
rectangle "Security and Quality Review" as Review
rectangle "Release Decision" as Decision
rectangle "Versioned Release" as Release
rectangle "Correction and Rework" as Rework

Increment --> Integration
Integration --> Testing
Testing --> Review
Review --> Decision

Decision --> Release : criteria satisfied
Decision --> Rework : criteria not satisfied

Rework --> Integration

note bottom of Release
A version tag is created only
after release approval.
end note

@enduml